    "body": "There are already some tests for this in combination with Document Isolation Policy. Unclear if the review bot looked at all of WPT.\r\n\r\nI think same origin-domain makes more sense here because this is about node access and that's the check we use for that. And with Document Isolation Policy we'll have to expand it to also check for same agent.",
