    "body": "I agree with @annevk about using same origin-domain here. I can file a new bug for Gecko. Edit: filed https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=2094566\r\n\r\n> Unclear if the review bot looked at all of WPT.\r\n\r\nIt missed `html/document-isolation-policy/agent-cluster.tentative.https.html`. That covers the agent cluster case but not `document.domain`, cross-origin forms, or opaque origins, according to my bot. The [proposed fix](https://github.com/zcorpan/wpt/tree/zcorpan/spec-review/html-13090/d1) for D1 adds tests for those.\r\n",
